 "fieldData": {
  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Invoice Automation Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is invoice automation?\", \"a\": \"Invoice automation is software that handles invoices without anyone retyping them. On the receiving side, it reads each vendor PDF into fields, codes the lines, and saves a bill. On the sending side, it creates the invoices you issue and sends them without anyone assembling each one by hand.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I set up an invoice automation system?\", \"a\": \"Pick one direction first: incoming vendor bills or outgoing client invoices. Describe where they arrive or what triggers them, and which fields a person must confirm. Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-automation-builder'>AI automation builder</a> turns that description into a working invoice automation system.\"}, {\"q\": \"Which invoice automation software is the best?\", \"a\": \"The best invoice automation software depends on which way your invoices travel. Rossum reads incoming invoices with AI agents and writes the data to your ERP. Basware pairs AP automation with a network for sending and receiving e-invoices. Building your own fits when your coding rules would need workarounds in a packaged tool.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are the benefits of an invoice automation solution?\", \"a\": \"The main benefit is that nobody retypes a bill. Finance reviews the handful of fields the model flags instead of keying every amount and due date, and the month closes with bills already coded. The app Emergent builds has no task cap: a month with 400 bills runs the same way as a month with 40.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can an automated invoice processing system read scanned invoices?\", \"a\": \"Yes. A scan or a phone photo is read the same way as a PDF, from the image of the page. Keep each invoice in one file with its pages in order before it reaches the inbox. A field the model cannot read with confidence, like a total under a stamp, waits for a person instead of posting as a guess.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can small businesses automate invoice processing?\", \"a\": \"Yes. A small business needs a shared inbox for vendor bills and one person to check what the model flags; it does not need an AP team. Start with the vendors who bill you every month. Emergent is free to start, and the app it builds has no per-seat pricing for the owner or the bookkeeper.\"}, {\"q\": \"How does automated invoice processing work?\", \"a\": \"Automated invoice processing starts when an invoice lands in a shared inbox, a vendor portal, or a scanner folder. A model reads it into a structured bill, and the bill moves on once its checks pass. Matching it to a purchase order and paying it belong to <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-automation-builder/accounts-payable-automation'>accounts payable automation</a>.\"}, {\"q\": \"What does AI invoice automation add to OCR?\", \"a\": \"AI invoice automation decides which text is the invoice number, which is the due date and which rows are line items, where OCR only turns the page into text. It does that without a template for each vendor's layout. That matters most for vendors who redesign their invoices, or who send a phone photo instead of a PDF.\"}, {\"q\": \"Is automated invoicing software the same as invoice processing automation?\", \"a\": \"No. Automated invoicing software starts from records you keep, like logged hours, and its job is pricing the work right. A vendor PDF is the reverse: the hard part is reading a document someone else designed. That is invoice processing automation, and a firm that buys parts and bills for labor needs both. Late payments belong to accounts receivable automation.\"}, {\"q\": \"What does invoice workflow automation include?\", \"a\": \"Invoice workflow automation is the routing around each bill: who signs off, in what order, and who covers when an approver is away. A bill over $5,000 might go to the department head before the controller sees it. If routing invoices for sign-off is the only part you need, an approval workflow is the smaller build.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
